{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"USN-8526-1","published":"2026-07-09T19:25:53Z","modified":"2026-07-10T02:35:14.039397414Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-47254","CVE-2026-47709","CVE-2026-47714","CVE-2026-48029","CVE-2026-50142","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47254","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47709","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47714","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-48029","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50142"],"summary":"libheif vulnerabilities","details":"Xianrui Dong discovered that libheif had an out-of-bounds read in its\nHEIF sequence track parser. An attacker could possibly use this issue\nto cause a denial of service or obtain sensitive information. This issue\nonly affected Ubuntu 26.04 LTS. (CVE-2026-47254)\n\nJunyi Liu discovered that libheif had a null pointer dereference in its\nimage tiling interface. An attacker could possibly use this issue to\ncause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-47709)\n\nCalvin Young and Enoch Chow discovered that libheif had an integer\noverflow in its inline mask size calculation. An attacker could\npossibly use this issue to cause a denial of service or obtain sensitive\ninformation. (CVE-2026-47714)\n\nAriel Koren discovered that libheif had an integer underflow in its\ngrid image tile coordinate transform. An attacker could possibly use\nthis issue to cause a denial of service or obtain sensitive information.\n(CVE-2026-48029)\n\nIt was discovered that libheif had a missing bound check in its HEIF\nsequence parser, allowing unbounded heap allocation. An attacker could\npossibly use this issue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-50142)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libheif","ecosystem":"Ubuntu:25.10","purl":"pkg:deb/ubuntu/libheif?arch=source&distro=questing"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"}]}],"versions":["1.19.7-1","1.19.8-1","1.20.2-1","1.20.2-1ubuntu0.1","1.20.2-1ubuntu0.3","1.20.2-1ubuntu0.4","1.20.2-1ubuntu0.5"],"ecosystem_specific":{"availability":"No subscription required","binaries":[{"binary_name":"heif-gdk-pixbuf","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"heif-thumbnailer","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"heif-view","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-examples","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-aomdec","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-aomenc","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-dav1d","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-ffmpegdec","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-j2kdec","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-j2kenc","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-jpegdec","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-jpegenc","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-kvazaar","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-libde265","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-rav1e","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-svtenc","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugin-x265","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif-plugins-all","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"},{"binary_name":"libheif1","binary_version":"1.20.2-1ubuntu0.6"}]},"database_specific":{"cves_map":{"cves":[],"ecosystem":"Ubuntu:25.10"},"source":"https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/main/osv/usn/USN-8526-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libheif","ecosystem":"Ubuntu:26.04:LTS","purl":"pkg:deb/ubuntu/libheif?arch=source&distro=resolute"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.21.2-3ubuntu0.3"}]}],"versions":["1.20.2-1","1.20.2-2","1.20.2-2build1","1.20.2-2build2","1.20.2-2ubuntu1","1.21.2-1","1.21.2-3","1.21.2-3ubuntu0.1","1.21.2-3ubuntu0.2"],"ecosystem_specific":{"availability":"No subscription required","binaries":[{"binary_